  <History Date="23-09-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (confusing charts.  contains some range conflicts.  note 32bit controls not currently supported - defined as 1x24bit + 1x8bit for now.  8bit parts have '+' suffix in attribute name.  default values not specified - made best guess)" Version="0" />
